(Kenya's demographic landscape is undergoing a critical demographic transition. With improvements in life) Tj
T* (expectancy and medical care, the population of persons aged 60 and above is expanding rapidly. Yet,) Tj
T* (customary communal safety nets, historically anchored within extended family structures, are under severe) Tj
T* (strain due to rapid urbanization, economic hardship, and generational poverty.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
50. 651.8899999999999864 Td
(Older persons in rural and peri-urban settlements frequently encounter extreme isolation, multidimensional) Tj
T* (poverty, and total exclusion from formal social security systems. According to grassroots assessments) Tj
T* (conducted across Nyamira County and neighboring regions, over 70% of senior-headed households lack) Tj
T* (predictable income or comprehensive medical insurance coverage.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.58 0.639 0.722 rg
