(Established in 2016 in Ekerenyo, MSC's dual approach combines center-based respite care with) Tj
T* (ward-based mobile volunteer rolls. Rather than institutionalizing older citizens away from their ancestral) Tj
T* (homes, the Ekerenyo Model empowers trained community volunteers who reside within the same village to) Tj
T* (deliver weekly home check-ins, medication adherence monitoring, and psychosocial fellowship.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
50. 633.8899999999999864 Td
