(To achieve genuine social equity for senior citizens, MSC recommends:) Tj
T* (1. Universal, non-contributory social pension coverage for all Kenyans aged 65 and above, disbursed) Tj
T* (through accessible local channels without digital exclusion.) Tj
T* (2. Dedicated geriatric healthcare desks and subsidized chronic disease medications across all Level 3 and) Tj
T* (Level 4 county health facilities.) Tj
T* (3. Robust legal aid and swift prosecution frameworks for elder property dispossession and abuse.) Tj
T* (4. Formal county government budgetary allocation and technical partnership with community-based elder) Tj
T* (welfare organizations.) Tj
ET
